  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "33408001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "今天天气不错，要一起出门逛逛吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33408002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "唉。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "33408004",
              "text": "怎么在叹气？"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "33408004",
              "text": "不想出门吗？"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "33408003",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33408004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "看看外面，下雨了。\n只要我想出门游玩，就会遇上坏天气，每次都这样。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33408005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那岂不是很遗憾。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33408006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "也许等到一切结束的那天，我才能和常人一样游山玩水吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "33408008",
              "text": "我会陪你一起等。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "33408008",
              "text": "我会帮你遮风挡雨。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "33408007",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33408008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "你还得好好努力，从胆量练起呢。\n听见雷鸣轰响的你，可不如现在这么坚定。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "options": [
            {
              "targetId": "33408010",
              "text": "听多就习惯了。"
            },
            {
              "targetId": "33408010",
              "text": "有你在就安心。"
            }
          ],
          "sourceId": "33408009",
          "sourceType": 4,
          "text": "",
          "type": "choice"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "33408010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "小乔",
          "text": "既然如此，那靠得再近一些，来听听我心口鼓动的雷鸣~",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
      "id": "33408",
